    "text": "2 days ago CARBONDALE - The Strip (Illinois Avenue) will be shut down two days in a row for back-to-back exciting events in downtown Carbondale this weekend. The first of these events is theCarbondale Halloween Homecoming Music Street Festival on Friday, Oct. 24, followed by the SIU Homecoming Parade on Saturday Oct. 25. Details of the traffic detours for these street closures are listed below. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
